ator","content":"@utsuboco"},{"name":"twitter:site","content":"@utsuboco"}],"links":[{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"en","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"ja-JP","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/ja/interactive-installations-for-hotels"},{"rel":"alternate","hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels"}],"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"headline\":\"Bring magic to your hotel. Interactive digital installations for hotels | Kiasa\",\"description\":\"Screen- and projector-based lobby experiences that lift dwell time and drive F&B and spa visits—backed by a simple CMS, seasonal programming, and privacy-safe attention analytics.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/utsuboco\",\"https://www.instagram.com/utsuboco/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/utsuboco/\"]},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/utsuboco\",\"https://www.instagram.com/utsuboco/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/utsuboco/\"]},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/landing/interactive-installations-for-hotels/ogp.png\",\"width\":1600,\"height\":900},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"serviceType\":\"Interactive Digital Installations for Hotels\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Kiasa\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/icons/web-app-manifest-512x512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512}},\"areaServed\":[\"Global\"],\"keywords\":[\"interactive hotel lobby\",\"hotel digital art installation\",\"projection mapping for hotels\",\"hotel guest engagement\",\"F&B upsell\",\"hotel CMS for signage\",\"attention analytics for retail/hospitality\"],\"about\":[\"interactive installations\",\"projectors\",\"large displays\",\"generative content\",\"CMS\",\"analytics\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.utsubo.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Bring magic to your hotel. Interactive digital installations for hotels | Kiasa\",\"item\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels#faqs\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can we control promos and content ourselves?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. A simple CMS lets you update copy, images, and QR links—plus schedule promos by time of day or event. Brand-locked templates keep everything on-brand with approvals.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this built from scratch for our brand?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We craft bespoke interactive experiences aligned to your brand, architecture, and audience. Then we deliver seasonal variants (e.g., Christmas, Halloween, Summer) that you can swap via CMS.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do analytics work—and is it privacy-safe?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"On-device AI estimates footfall, unique impressions, dwell time, and attention (looking/not looking). Reports are aggregated; no facial recognition or image storage. Age/gender breakdowns can be provided as approximate estimates if your policy allows.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the typical investment?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Single-zone lobby packages typically range from $15k–$40k for creative/setup, plus $800–$2,000/month for CMS/analytics/support. Multi-zone or flagship installs can range from $45k–$120k+ with $1,500–$3,500/month support. Hardware varies by display/projector spec.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the timeline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A focused lobby zone can be delivered in 2–4 weeks after approval. Larger or highly bespoke experiences typically require 8–16 weeks. We can coordinate with your AV partner or supply media players.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you operate globally?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We design and develop remotely and coordinate with local AV integrators worldwide for installation. Remote monitoring and SLA support are available.\"}}]}"],"features":["contact-form","faq"],"html":"<div class=\"progressive-blur\" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            z-index: 1;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n          \" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume></div><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.15625px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.15625px);\n            z-index: 2;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%);\n          \" data-astro-cid