ass=\"lp-title lp-hero__title align-left\"><h1 class=\"lp-title__main \">Bring magic to your hotel.</h1><p class=\"lp-title__sub \">Interactive digital installations that turn stays into stories.<br> Give guests a reason to stop, smile, share—and spend more time (and money) on property.</p></div><div class=\"lp-hero__ctas\"><a href=\"https://cal.com/utsubo/30min?source_url=%2Finteractive-installations-for-hotels\" class=\"lp-btn lp-btn-- \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a Demo</a></div></div></section><div class=\"lp-hero__media hero-media-ee\"><video autoplay loop muted playsinline aria-label=\"Interactive digital installations for luxury hotel lobbies.\"><source src=\"/landing/common/installation_hero.mp4\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\"><source src=\"/landing/common/installation_hero_medium.mp4\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\"><source src=\"/landing/common/installation_hero_sp.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"lp-sections flx-column\" data-astro-cid-dqre45pz><section class=\"why-section flx-column big-pt\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h2 data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Why modern hotels<br> choose interactive lobbies</h2><div class=\"why-items\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Lobbies aren’t selling.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Footfall is high, attention is low. We convert idle minutes into <strong>branded moments and upsell opportunities.</strong></p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Hard to stand out.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Every hotel claims “experience.” We make it <strong>tangible, filmable—and Instagrammable—</strong>so guests share it for you.</p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Families need engagement.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Keep kids <strong>delighted</strong>, parents <strong>relaxed</strong>, and <strong>dwell time up.</strong></p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Promos get ignored.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Add <strong>subtle promo overlays</strong> to experiences so guests discover restaurants, bars, spa, events—without feeling “sold to.”</p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>No measurement.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Get <strong>attention analytics</strong> (impressions, dwell, gaze/attention rate) to prove impact.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"big-py\" data-astro-cid-dqre45pz><section id=\"services\" class=\"services\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__inner flx-column\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__header\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__heading\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><p class=\"services__eyebrow\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb>What we create for your property</p><h2 class=\"services__title\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb>Our Services</h2></div></div><div class=\"services__grid\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__card bg-card \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__video-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><video src=\"/landing/hotel-interactive-installations/immersive-experiences.mp4\" class=\"services__image\" autoplay loop muted playsinline data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md></video></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Immersive Experiences</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Immersive interactive installations for hotel lobbies that react to guest movement and presence, turning waiting time into memorable lobby experiences.</p></div></div><div class=\"services__card bg-card \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__video-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><video src=\"/landing/hotel-interactive-installations/kids-corner.mp4\" class=\"services__image\" autoplay loop muted playsinline data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md></video></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Interactive Kids Corner</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Kids corner for hotels with games and interactive stories that keep children engaged, parents relaxed and families happy to spend more time onsite.</p></div></div><div class=\"services__card bg-card \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__video-wrapper blend-exclusion\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><video src=\"/landing/hotel-interactive-installations/digital-arts.mp4\" class=\"services__image\" autoplay loop muted playsinline data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md></video></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Digital Art</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Curated digital art for hotel lobbies that animates your space with generative visuals, brand-inspired content and seasonal themes, keeping the space fresh and dynamic.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class=\"lp-clients flx-col-center\"><p class=\"lp-clients__info med-txt\">We’re an award-winning studio<br> trusted by leading brands.</p><div class=\"lp-clients-wrapper\"><div class=\"lp-clients-scroll\"><div class=\"lp-clients__track\"><div class=\"lp-clients__group\"><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/jr.svg\" alt=\"JR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/lv.svg\" alt=\"Louis Vuitton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"35\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/kia.svg\" alt=\"Kia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/league-of-legends.svg\" alt=\"League of Legends\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/bmw.svg\" alt=\"BMW\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/warner.svg\" alt=\"Warner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/smrj.svg\" alt=\"SMRJ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\"></div></div><div class=\"lp-clients__group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/jr.svg\" alt=\"JR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/lv.svg\" alt=\"Louis Vuitton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"35\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/kia.svg\" alt=\"Kia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/league-of-legends.svg\" alt=\"League of Legends\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/bmw.svg\" alt=\"BMW\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/warner.svg\" alt=\"Warner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/smrj.svg\" alt=\"SMRJ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-stats flx-col-center\"><p class=\"lp-stats__lead lp-highlight__text\">Hotels plan to boost guest-experience tech investment by 16% this year, with 85% betting on personalized experiences to drive extra revenue. </p><a href=\"https://www.amadeus-hospitality.com/resources/travel-technology-investment-trends-2024\" class=\"lp-stats__sub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Travel Technology Investment Trends 2024, Amadeus Hospitality </a></section><section id=\"faqs\" class=\"lp-faq flx-column\"><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main \">FAQs</h2></div><div class=\"lp-faq__list\"><div class=\"lp-faq__item open\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can we control promos and content ourselves?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: none;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. A simple CMS lets you update copy, images, and QR links—plus schedule promos by time of day or event. Brand-locked templates keep everything on-brand with approvals.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">−</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Is this built from scratch for our brand?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>We craft bespoke interactive experiences aligned to your brand, architecture, and audience. Then we deliver seasonal variants (e.g., Christmas, Halloween, Summer) that you can swap via CMS.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>How do analytics work—and is it privacy-safe?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>On-device AI estimates footfall, unique impressions, dwell time, and attention (looking/not looking). Reports are aggregated; no facial recognition or image storage. Age/gender breakdowns can be provided as approximate estimates if your policy allows.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What is the typical investment?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Single-zone lobby packages typically range from $15k–$40k for creative/setup, plus $800–$2,000/month for CMS/analytics/support. Multi-zone or flagship installs can range from $45k–$120k+ with $1,500–$3,500/month support. Hardware varies by display/projector spec.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What is the timeline?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>A focused lobby zone can be delivered in 2–4 weeks after approval. Larger or highly bespoke experiences typically require 8–16 weeks. We can coordinate with your AV partner or supply media players.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you operate globally?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We design and develop remotely and coordinate with local AV integrators worldwide for installation. Remote monitoring and SLA support are available.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>How do we start?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p><a href=\"https://cal.com/utsubo/30min?source_url=%2Finteractive-installations-for-hotels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a 15-min demo</a>. Share a floor plan/photos, target guest, and timeline—we'll return concepts and a budgetary estimate.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-contact flx-center\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-card bg-card\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-mc flx\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact__head\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main small\">Make your lobby<br> the reason guests remember.</h2><p class=\"lp-title__sub \">Book a demo or request a tailored estimate.</p></div></div><form class=\"lp-form\" id=\"contact-form\" action=\"/api/contact\" method=\"post\" novalidate data-recaptcha-key=\"6LdRYBYsAAAAAA2OQWd799h3rjCrQmjpitTquLri\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page\" value=\"https://www.utsubo.com/interactive-installations-for-hotels\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><label for=\"lp-hp-field\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef>Leave this field empty</label><input id=\"lp-hp-field\" type=\"text\" name=\"hp_field\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef></div><div class=\"lp-form__grid\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-form__field\"><label class=\"lp-form__label\" for=\"fld-name\"> Name <span class=\"lp-form__req\">*</span></label><input class=\"lp-form__input\" id=\"fld-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder value required autocomplete=\"name\"><p class=\"lp-form__er